  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You reinforce armor and hone the edge of weapons.</p><p>Touch a metal weapon or suit of armor.</p><p>A weapon affected by this spell deals <strong>+1 Damage</strong>.</p><p>A suit of armor affected by this spell gains <strong>+1 Armor</strong>.</p><p>In either case, the item is considered <strong>Magical</strong>.</p><p>These effects last until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can increase the bonus to <strong>Damag</strong>e or <strong>Armor</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per two extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.KsGRggimv1zILCLO]{Reinforce Metal (Armor)}, @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.Bc9O0WngigS9esxc]{Reinforce Metal (Weapon)}</p>",
